hanvil bundles third-party material:

proto/services/*.proto — Hedera API (HAPI) protocol buffer definitions.
  Source: https://github.com/hiero-ledger/hiero-consensus-node
          hapi/hedera-protobuf-java-api/src/main/proto/services/
  License: Apache License 2.0. Copyright Hedera Hashgraph, LLC / Hiero, a Series of LF Projects, LLC.
  Copied unmodified on 2026-09-07 so the gRPC surface compiles offline.

Predefined account keys (src/keys/predefined.rs) are the published development keys of
hiero-ledger/hiero-local-node (src/configuration/accountConfiguration.json), reproduced so that
tooling configured for that project works unchanged. They are public and must never hold value.

src/harness/ — a Rust port of hedera-harness.
  Source: https://github.com/hedera-dev/hedera-harness, branch dev, commit 587a2f3 (v2.0.0-rc.4).
  License: MIT. Copyright Hedera Hashgraph, LLC.
  The prompt templates (src/harness/prompts/*.md), the project skeletons (src/harness/skeletons/),
  the recipe schema, finding identifiers, console and error strings are reproduced or translated
  from that repository so recipes and agents behave the same under both harnesses.
